    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66826" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετανίσομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἠέλιος μετενίσετο βουλυτόνδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.779
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.58
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>pass into, enter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρκίνον ἠέλιος μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.384.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a river,
				<i>flow into</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.628
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>pursue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				131
			</span></i> (anap.); <i>win, get possession of</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>; <i>go in quest of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1245
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				1 iii 37
			</span></i> (lyr., -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεισεται</span> Pap.).</div>
